# Push after every update

After finishing any substantive code or config change in this repo:

1. Commit relevant files (never `.env` or secrets).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch immediately.
3. Do not wait for the user to ask to push.

Use author/committer `DignityDC <dignitydcgit@gmail.com>` via env vars for commits (do not change git config).
